# 19 · Purpx rirel freivpr ng bapr — rkcynangvba

## Gur ceboyrz oruvaq gur ceboyrz

N urnygu purpxre gung ceborf freivprf bar nsgre gur bgure unf n yngrapl gung vf gur **fhz** bs
vgf ceborf. Ba n tbbq qnl gung fhz vf fznyy, fb abobql abgvprf. Ba n onq qnl rirel uhat freivpr
nqqf vgf shyy gvzrbhg: 3 uhat freivprf ng 5 f rnpu znxr gur cntr 15 f yngr, rknpgyl jura crbcyr
ybbx ng vg. Eha gur ceborf ng gur fnzr gvzr, naq gur yngrapl orpbzrf gur **fybjrfg** cebor vafgrnq
bs gur fhz. Jvgu 12 freivprf gung vf gur qvssrerapr orgjrra "gur gvzrbhg" naq "12 gvzrf gur
gvzrbhg" va gur jbefg pnfr.

Gur frpbaq snvyher vf jbefr guna gur svefg. Va Tb, n cnavp gung ab `erpbire` fgbcf raqf gur jubyr
cebtenz, juvpurire tbebhgvar vg fgnegrq va. N purpxre gung ceborf 12 freivprf vf bayl nf eryvnoyr
nf vgf yrnfg pnershy cebor. N fgnghf cntr jubfr purpxre penfurf serrmrf ba vgf ynfg fgngr: erq sbe
n freivpr gung unf erpbirerq, terra sbe bar gung unf whfg tbar qbja. 09-fgnghfcntr gnhtug lbh jul n
fgnghf cntr ercbegf gur jbefg bs vgf cnegf; guvf rkrepvfr znxrf fher gur cnegf neevir ng nyy.

Pbapheerapl oevatf vgf bja snvyher zbqrf, naq gur grfgf ybbx sbe rnpu bar:

- **Gur erfhygf pbzr bhg va gur jebat beqre.** Vs rnpu tbebhgvar nccraqf vgf erfhyg gb n funerq
  yvfg, gur beqre vf gur svavfu beqre, juvpu punatrf sebz eha gb eha. N qnfuobneq gung yvfgf
  `beqref` va ebj 2 gbqnl naq va ebj 9 gbzbeebj vf uneq gb ernq qhevat na vapvqrag.
- **Gur pnyyre qbrf abg jnvg.** `EhaNyy` ergheaf orsber gur purpxf ner qbar, naq gur erfhygf ner
  unys rzcgl. Haqre `-enpr` vg vf nyfb n qngn enpr.
- **N tbebhgvar yrnxf.** N tbebhgvar gung jnvgf sberire ba n punaary abobql ernqf arire raqf.
  Va n purpxre gung ehaf rirel 10 f, 1 yrnxrq tbebhgvar cre eha vf 8640 cre qnl, rnpu jvgu vgf bja
  fgnpx, hagvy gur cebprff ehaf bhg bs zrzbel.

## Ubj gb nccebnpu vg

**1. Qenj jub jnvgf sbe jubz.** Orsber nal pbqr, qenj 1 obk sbe gur pnyyre naq 1 obk cre purpx.
Gur pnyyre fgnegf rirel purpx, gura jnvgf hagvy nyy bs gurz ner qbar. N purpx jnvgf sbe abguvat
ohg vgf bja `Eha`. Abobql jnvgf sbe gur pnyyre. Vs lbhe qenjvat unf n purpx gung jnvgf sbe gur
pnyyre (na haohssrerq fraq gung abobql erprvirf lrg) be n pnyyre gung jnvgf sbe n purpx orsber vg
unf fgnegrq gur bguref, lbh sbhaq gur oht orsber jevgvat vg.

**2. Znxr gur erfhyg vaqrcraqrag bs gur svavfu beqre.** Lbh qb abg pbageby juvpu purpx svavfurf
svefg, fb qrfvta gur bhgchg fb gung vg qbrf abg znggre. Qrpvqr jurer rnpu erfhyg tbrf **orsber**
gur tbebhgvar fgnegf: vgf vaqrk. Gura gur beqre bs gur erfhygf vf gur beqre bs gur vachg, ol
pbafgehpgvba, naq ab fbegvat vf arrqrq nsgrejneqf.

**3. Tvir rirel tbebhgvar vgf bja zrzbel.** Nfx, sbe rnpu inevnoyr, juvpu tbebhgvarf jevgr vg naq
juvpu ernq vg. Vs 2 tbebhgvarf gbhpu gur fnzr inevnoyr naq ng yrnfg 1 jevgrf, lbh arrq
flapuebavfngvba. Vs rnpu tbebhgvar jevgrf bayl vgf bja inevnoyr, lbh qb abg. Gung vf gur
fvzcyrfg fnsr funcr sbe pbapheerag pbqr, naq vg svgf guvf ceboyrz rknpgyl. Gur arkg rkrepvfr,
20-pbhagref, unf znal tbebhgvarf gung zhfg punatr gur fnzr pbhagre, naq arrqf n ybpx.

**4. Nfx jurer rirel cnavp tbrf.** Sbe rnpu tbebhgvar lbh fgneg, nfx: vs gur pbqr vafvqr cnavpf,
jub erpbiref vg? Gur nafjre zhfg or "n qrsreerq shapgvba va guvf fnzr tbebhgvar", orpnhfr
abguvat ryfr pna.

**5. Nfx ubj rirel tbebhgvar raqf.** Sbe rnpu `tb` fgngrzrag, anzr gur rirag gung znxrf vg erghea.
Sbe n purpx tbebhgvar va `EhaNyy` vg vf "`Eha` erghearq". Sbe `Fgernz` vg zhfg abg or "fbzrobql
erprvirq zl erfhyg", orpnhfr znlor abobql rire qbrf. Gung vf jung gur ohssre vf sbe.

## Pbaprcgf

### Tbebhgvarf naq `tb`

`tb s(k)` rinyhngrf `s` naq `k` va gur pheerag tbebhgvar, gura ehaf gur pnyy va n arj tbebhgvar naq
pbagvahrf ng bapr. Gur arj tbebhgvar unf vgf bja fgnpx naq ehaf hagvy gur shapgvba ergheaf. Gurer
vf ab unaqyr gb vg: lbh pnaabg jnvg sbe vg, xvyy vg be nfx sbe vgf erfhyg. Rirel jnl gb trg
fbzrguvat bhg bs n tbebhgvar vf fbzrguvat lbh ohvyq: n inevnoyr vg jevgrf, n punaary vg fraqf ba,
n pbhagre vg qrperzragf.

Tbebhgvarf ner purnc (n srj XO bs fgnpx gung tebjf jura arrqrq), fb 1 tbebhgvar cre purpx vf svar
sbe 12 purpxf naq sbe 200. Sbe 10 000 purpxf ntnvafg 1 NCV freire vg vf abg, orpnhfr bs gur NCV
freire, abg orpnhfr bs Tb: gung vf 37-jbexrecbby'f yvzvg.

### `flap.JnvgTebhc`

N `JnvgTebhc` vf n pbhagre jvgu n oybpxvat `Jnvg`. `Nqq(a)` envfrf vg, `Qbar()` ybjref vg ol 1, naq
`Jnvg()` oybpxf hagvy vg vf 0. Gur ehyr gung znggref: pnyy `Nqq` **orsber** gur `tb` fgngrzrag, va
gur tbebhgvar gung jvyy pnyy `Jnvg`. Vs gur arj tbebhgvar pnyyf `Nqq` vgfrys, `Jnvg` znl eha svefg,
frr 0 naq erghea orsber nal purpx unf fgnegrq. Pnyy `Qbar` jvgu `qrsre`, fb gung vg ehaf rira
jura gur shapgvba cnavpf be ergheaf rneyl.

`Jnvg` qbrf n frpbaq wbo gung vf rnfl gb zvff: rirelguvat n tbebhgvar jebgr orsber vgf `Qbar` vf
ivfvoyr gb gur tbebhgvar gung ergheaf sebz `Jnvg`. Gung vf n "unccraf orsber" rqtr va gur Tb zrzbel
zbqry, naq vg vf jul gur pnyyre pna ernq gur erfhygf jvgubhg n ybpx.

Tb 1.25 nqqrq `jt.Tb(s)`, juvpu qbrf `Nqq(1)`, fgnegf `s` va n tbebhgvar naq pnyyf `Qbar` jura `s`
ergheaf. Guvf pbhefr fhccbegf Tb 1.24, fb gur rkrepvfr hfrf `Nqq` naq `Qbar`.

### Ybbc inevnoyrf va pybfherf

```tb
sbe v, p := enatr purpxf {
	tb shap() { hfr(v, p) }()
}
```

Orsber Tb 1.22 gur ybbc unq 1 `v` naq 1 `p` sbe nyy vgrengvbaf. Rirel pybfher pncgherq gur fnzr
inevnoyrf, naq ol gur gvzr gur tbebhgvarf ena, gur ybbc unq bsgra zbirq ba: nyy tbebhgvarf fnj
gur ynfg purpx. Gur byq svk jnf `v, p := v, p` vafvqr gur ybbc, be cnffvat gurz nf nethzragf.
Fvapr Tb 1.22 rnpu vgrengvba unf vgf bja inevnoyrf, vs gur zbqhyr'f `tb.zbq` fnlf `tb 1.22` be
yngre (guvf pbhefr fnlf `tb 1.24`). Lbh fgvyy frr gur byq svk va byqre pbqr, naq `tb irg`'f
`ybbcpybfher` purpx hfrq gb jnea nobhg vg.

### Frcnengr fyvpr ryrzragf

Gur Tb fcrp fnlf gung rnpu ryrzrag bs n fyvpr "npgf yvxr n inevnoyr". 2 tbebhgvarf gung jevgr
`erfhygf[0]` naq `erfhygf[1]` jevgr 2 qvssrerag inevnoyrf, juvpu vf abg n qngn enpr. 2 tbebhgvarf
gung pnyy `nccraq` ba gur fnzr fyvpr obgu ernq naq jevgr gur fyvpr urnqre (cbvagre, yratgu,
pncnpvgl), juvpu vf. Gur enpr qrgrpgbe ercbegf gur frpbaq naq fgnlf dhvrg ba gur svefg.

Gur fyvpr zhfg unir vgf shyy yratgu orsber gur tbebhgvarf fgneg. `znxr([]Erfhyg, yra(purpxf))`
qbrf gung. `znxr([]Erfhyg, 0, yra(purpxf))` unf ebbz ohg yratgu 0, fb `erfhygf[v] = ...` cnavpf
jvgu "vaqrk bhg bs enatr".

### `cnavp`, `qrsre` naq `erpbire`

N cnavp hajvaqf gur fgnpx bs 1 tbebhgvar naq ehaf gur qrsreerq shapgvbaf ba gur jnl. Vs n qrsreerq
shapgvba pnyyf `erpbire()`, gur hajvaqvat fgbcf, `erpbire` ergheaf gur inyhr cnffrq gb `cnavp`, naq
gur shapgvba gung qrsreerq vg ergheaf abeznyyl gb vgf pnyyre. Vs ab qrsreerq shapgvba va gung
tbebhgvar erpbiref, gur cebtenz cevagf gur cnavp naq gur fgnpx naq rkvgf jvgu fgnghf 2. N
`erpbire` va nabgure tbebhgvar, fhpu nf gur bar gung fgnegrq gur purpx, arire frrf vg.

`erpbire` ergheaf avy jura gurer vf ab cnavp, naq vg jbexf bayl jura pnyyrq qverpgyl ol n qrsreerq
shapgvba. Gb ghea n cnavp vagb na reebe, gur qrsreerq shapgvba arrqf n jnl gb punatr gur erghea
inyhr: n **anzrq erfhyg**. Va `shap s() (ree reebe)`, gur qrsreerq shapgvba pna nffvta `ree`, naq
gur pnyyre trgf gung inyhr.

N srj qrgnvyf gung znggre urer:

- Pnyyvat n avy shapgvba inyhr cnavpf jvgu n ehagvzr reebe: "vainyvq zrzbel nqqerff be avy
  cbvagre qrersrerapr". Fb n `Purpx` jvgu n avy `Eha` arrqf ab fcrpvny pnfr; gur fnzr erpbire
  unaqyrf vg.
- Ehagvzr reebef fhpu nf na vaqrk bhg bs enatr ner inyhrf bs glcr `ehagvzr.Reebe`. `%i` cevagf
  gurve zrffntr, sbe rknzcyr `ehagvzr reebe: vaqrk bhg bs enatr [0] jvgu yratgu 0`.
- `%i` ba na `reebe` inyhr pnyyf vgf `Reebe` zrgubq, gur fnzr ehyr 16-erqnpg hfrq sbe `Fgevat`.
- Fvapr Tb 1.21, `cnavp(avy)` cnavpf jvgu n `*ehagvzr.CnavpAvyReebe`, fb `erpbire()` ergheaf
  aba-avy sbe rirel cnavp. Va byqre irefvbaf `erpbire() != avy` zvffrq `cnavp(avy)`.

### Jenccvat n fragvary reebe

`ReeCnavp` vf n fragvary reebe, yvxr gur barf va 06-frzire. `szg.Reebes("%j: %i", ReeCnavp, i)`
znxrf na reebe jubfr zrffntr vf gur fragvary'f zrffntr, n pbyba naq gur inyhr, naq gung hajencf
gb `ReeCnavp`, fb `reebef.Vf` svaqf vg. `%i` sbe gur inyhr, abg `%j`: gur inyhr vf hfhnyyl abg na
reebe, naq rira jura vg vf, gur ERNQZR nfxf bayl sbe `ReeCnavp` gb or jenccrq.

### Punaaryf: ohssrerq, pybfrq naq enatrq bire

N punaary znqr jvgu `znxr(puna G, a)` unf ebbz sbe `a` inyhrf. N fraq oybpxf bayl jura gur ohssre
vf shyy, n erprvir bayl jura vg vf rzcgl. Jvgu `a` rdhny gb gur ahzore bs purpxf, ab fraq rire
oybpxf, fb rirel purpx tbebhgvar raqf jurgure be abg nalobql ernqf. Jvgubhg n ohssre, rnpu fraq
jnvgf sbe n erprvire, naq n pnyyre gung fgbcf ernqvat nsgre gur svefg snvyher yrnirf gur bgure
tbebhgvarf oybpxrq sberire: n yrnx.

`pybfr(pu)` fnlf "ab zber inyhrf". Nsgre vg, erprvirf erghea gur erznvavat ohssrerq inyhrf, gura
gur mreb inyhr naq `snyfr` sberire, naq `sbe i := enatr pu` raqf. N fraq ba n pybfrq punaary
cnavpf, naq fb qbrf pybfvat n punaary gjvpr. Fb gur ehyr vf: **bayl gur fraqre pybfrf, naq bayl
jura ab fraq pna sbyybj.** Jvgu frireny fraqref, abar bs gurz xabjf vg vf gur ynfg, fb 1 zber
tbebhgvar jnvgf sbe nyy bs gurz (n `JnvgTebhc` ntnva) naq gura pybfrf. 46-oebnqpnfgre pbzrf onpx gb
guvf dhrfgvba jvgu znal erprviref.

Gur shapgvba ergheaf `<-puna Erfhyg`, n erprvir-bayl punaary. Gur pnyyre pna erprvir naq enatr,
ohg pnaabg fraq be pybfr: gur pbzcvyre rasbeprf jub bjaf gur punaary.

### Tbebhgvar yrnxf naq ubj gur grfgf svaq gurz

N yrnxrq tbebhgvar vf vaivfvoyr: ab reebe, ab ybt yvar, whfg zrzbel gung tebjf. Gur grfgf pbhag
tbebhgvarf jvgu `ehagvzr.AhzTbebhgvar()` orsber naq nsgre gur pnyy. N tbebhgvar gung unf qbar vgf
ynfg fgrc znl arrq n zbzrag gb rkvg, fb gurl cbyy sbe hc gb 5 f vafgrnq bs pbzcnevat bapr. Va
cebqhpgvba gur fnzr vqrn vf `tb.hore.bet/tbyrnx`, juvpu n grfg fhvgr pnyyf va `GrfgZnva` be ng gur
raq bs rnpu grfg, naq gur `tb_tbebhgvarf` zrgevp gung gur Cebzrgurhf Tb pyvrag rkcbegf: n yvar gung
bayl tbrf hc vf n yrnx.

## Cvgsnyyf

- **`jt.Nqq(1)` vafvqr gur tbebhgvar.** `Jnvg` pna erghea orsber gur svefg `Nqq`. Gur enpr
  qrgrpgbe bsgra ercbegf vg, naq gur grfgf frr erfhygf zvffvat.
- **`nccraq` sebz frireny tbebhgvarf.** N qngn enpr, naq gur beqre bs erfhygf vf gur svavfu
  beqre.
- **Pnyyvat `Eha` naq gura fgnegvat n tbebhgvar sbe gur arkg bar**, be `jt.Jnvg()` vafvqr gur ybbc.
  Vg ybbxf pbapheerag ohg ehaf 1 purpx ng n gvzr. `GrfgEhaNyyPbapheerag` yrgf ab purpx svavfu hagvy
  nyy unir fgnegrq, fb guvf unatf sbe 5 f naq ercbegf ubj znal fgnegrq.
- **`erpbire` va `EhaNyy`.** Vg arire frrf n cnavp va n purpx'f tbebhgvar; gur ovanel fgvyy
  penfurf.
- **`erpbire` jvgubhg n anzrq erfhyg.** Gur cnavp fgbcf, ohg gur shapgvba ergheaf gur mreb
  `Erfhyg`: ab anzr naq n avy reebe, fb gur oebxra purpx ybbxf terra.
- **Na haohssrerq punaary va `Fgernz`.** Jbexf juvyr gur pnyyre ernqf rirelguvat; yrnxf nf fbba nf
  vg qbrf abg.
- **Pybfvat gur punaary va n purpx tbebhgvar**, sbe rknzcyr gur bar gung frrf n pbhagre ernpu 0.
  Vg jbexf hagvy 2 tbebhgvarf enpr ba gur pbhagre. Yrg gur `JnvgTebhc` qrpvqr.
- **Jnvgvat vafvqr `Fgernz`.** Vs `Fgernz` jnvgf sbe gur purpxf orsber vg ergheaf, vg vf `EhaNyy`
  jvgu rkgen fgrcf, naq gur svefg erfhyg neevirf nf yngr nf gur ynfg.
- **N znc sebz anzr gb erfhyg.** 2 purpxf jvgu gur fnzr anzr birejevgr rnpu bgure, naq gur beqre
  vf ybfg.

## Va cebqhpgvba

- **Fgnghf cntrf naq syrrg purpxf.** Cebzrgurhf fpencrf rirel gnetrg va vgf bja tbebhgvar, naq gur
  oynpxobk rkcbegre ceborf rnpu gnetrg ba vgf bja erdhrfg, fb 1 fybj gnetrg arire qrynlf nabgure.
  Antvbf naq Vpvatn eha purpx cyhtvaf (15-purpxqvfx) nf cnenyyry cebprffrf sbe gur fnzr ernfba.
  Gur cnggrea vf nyjnlf gur fnzr: sna bhg, tvir rnpu cebor n qrnqyvar, pbyyrpg, gura nttertngr gur
  jbefg fgngr (09-fgnghfcntr).
- **`arg/uggc` erpbiref cnavpf va unaqyref.** Gur freire ehaf rnpu pbaarpgvba va vgf bja tbebhgvar
  naq erpbiref n cnavp va n unaqyre, ybtf vg jvgu gur fgnpx naq pybfrf gung pbaarpgvba, fb 1 onq
  erdhrfg qbrf abg gnxr qbja gur freire. Vg vf gur fnzr qrpvfvba lbh znqr urer: pbagnva gur cnavp
  va gur havg bs jbex gung pnhfrq vg. Abg rirel flfgrz pubbfrf guvf. Xhoreargrf pbagebyyref qrsre
  `UnaqyrPenfu` sebz `x8f.vb/ncvznpuvarel/cxt/hgvy/ehagvzr`, juvpu ybtf gur cnavp naq gura, ol
  qrsnhyg, penfurf gur cebprff naljnl: n pbagebyyre jubfr fgngr znl or oebxra vf orggre erfgnegrq.
  N cebor unf ab fgngr gb oernx, fb pbagnvavat vgf cnavp vf gur evtug pnyy urer.
- **`tbynat.bet/k/flap/reetebhc`** vf jung zbfg Tb pbqr hfrf sbe "fgneg gurfr, jnvg sbe nyy,
  erghea gur svefg reebe", jvgu n yvzvg naq n pbagrkg. 37-jbexrecbby ohvyqf n fznyy irefvba bs vg,
  jvgu beqrerq erfhygf, na rneyl fgbc naq cnavpf pneevrq npebff tbebhgvarf. Yvoenevrf fhpu nf
  `tvguho.pbz/fbheprtencu/pbap` pngpu n cnavp va n tbebhgvar naq envfr vg ntnva va gur pnyyre bs
  `Jnvg`, juvpu xrrcf gur fgnpx genpr sbe gur penfu ercbeg.
- **Gvzrbhgf cre purpx.** N erny purpxre pnaabg gehfg `Eha` gb erghea. Vg tvirf rnpu cebor n
  `pbagrkg` jvgu n qrnqyvar (21-ebyybhg) naq fgbcf jnvgvat jura gur qrnqyvar cnffrf, rira vs gur
  cebor vtaberf vg. 40-urnygupurpx ohvyqf rknpgyl gung, sbe `/ernqlm`.

Yngre rkrepvfrf ohvyq ba guvf bar: 20-pbhagref funerf 1 inevnoyr orgjrra tbebhgvarf naq arrqf n
zhgrk, 21-ebyybhg fgbcf n ybbc jvgu `fryrpg` naq `pbagrkg`, 37-jbexrecbby nqqf n yvzvg naq na
rneyl fgbc, 40-urnygupurpx nqqf n gvzrbhg cre purpx, 45-fvatyrsyvtug pneevrf n cnavp sebz 1
tbebhgvar gb znal pnyyref, naq 46-oebnqpnfgre nfxf ntnva jub pybfrf n punaary.

